# Database migrations directory
# 
# Place your golang-migrate migration files here following this naming convention:
# 
#   {VERSION}_{NAME}.up.sql    - Apply migration
#   {VERSION}_{NAME}.down.sql  - Rollback migration
#
# Example:
#   000001_initial_schema.up.sql
#   000001_initial_schema.down.sql
#   000002_add_users_table.up.sql
#   000002_add_users_table.down.sql
#
# See ../MIGRATIONS.md for detailed guide.
